      "message": "feat: add daily agentic workflow for docs and blueprint sync\n\nCo-authored-by: LionSR <14889516+LionSR@users.noreply.github.com>\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/LionSR/TNLean/sessions/1b8c289c-bd13-442f-a902-9d669d6db83b",
