      "message": "fix(ci): allow docs sync to modify CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md (#1116) (#1123)\n\nThe Docs & Blueprint Sync workflow failed because the safe-outputs\nconfiguration blocks modification of agent instruction files (CLAUDE.md,\nAGENTS.md). These are legitimate documentation targets for a docs-sync\nworkflow.\n\nAdd allowed-files: [CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md] to the create-pull-request\nsafe-outputs config so the workflow can update these files when they\nare out of sync with recent code changes, while still protecting\npackage manifests and other protected files.\n\nCloses #1116\n\nCo-authored-by: texra-ai <texra-ai@users.noreply.github.com>",
